msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「（Whew...... Spotless at last......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Uff...... Impecable por fin......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I do want to use the vacuum cleaner,＿but Yasuko's still asleep.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Sí quiero pasar la aspiradora,＿pero Yasuko sigue dormida.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（At least I was able to sweep up the＿spilled tea leaves. Yep, I've done as＿much as I possibly could.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Al menos pude barrer las hojas＿de té derramadas. Sí, ya hice＿todo lo que pude.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Beauty obtained over a single night!＿My talent is frightening, if I do say so＿myself. Hehehehe......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Belleza lograda en una sola noche!＿Mi talento da miedo, aunque esté mal＿que yo lo diga. Jejejeje......）」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HA, HAP, HAP」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「FE, FEL, FEL」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmm? What's up, Inko-chan?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mmm? ¿Qué pasa, Inko-chan?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HAP, HAP, HAPP!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡FE, FEL, FELI!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh!? Inko-chan, are you only just now＿wishing me a Happy New Year?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Eh?! Inko-chan, ¿apenas ahora＿me deseas un Feliz Año Nuevo?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HAPPY?」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¿FELIZ?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Good, good. Next you say New Year.＿N-E-W-Y-E-A-R. Now, give it a try!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, bien. Ahora di Año Nuevo.＿A-Ñ-O-N-U-E-V-O. ¡Vamos, inténtalo!」"

msgid "Inko-chan「HAP, HAPPEN...... OPEN!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「FEL, FELI...... ¡ABIERTO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Open?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Abierto?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「CO, CO...... COLD!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「FR, FR...... ¡FRÍO!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Ohh, I see. The window's open and＿you're cold. I opened it while I was＿cleaning. Sorry about that, Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ohh, ya veo. La ventana está＿abierta y tienes frío. La abrí mientras＿limpiaba. Perdón por eso, Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Heh, standing near the window, I＿can't help but look.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Je, estando junto a la ventana,＿no puedo evitar mirar.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That damn Taiga...... She really didn't＿come over and eat with us......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Esa maldita Taiga...... De verdad no＿vino a comer con nosotros......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, don't tell me she called for＿delivery?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿no me digas que pidió＿comida a domicilio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Kushieda?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hello?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hola?」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, this is Kushieda. Is this a good＿time?」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, soy Kushieda. ¿Es un buen momento?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, it's good. 'Sup?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, claro. ¿Qué tal?」"

msgid "Minori「Well, you see, I know this is selfish of＿me, but if you happen to be free, I have＿a favor to ask, if you don't mind?」"
msgstr "Minori「Bueno, sé que es egoísta de mi parte,＿pero si estás libre, ¿puedo pedirte＿un favor, si no te molesta?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, shoot.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro, dime.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I don't mind, but what's Taiga up＿to?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, no me importa, pero ¿qué＿anda haciendo Taiga?」"

msgid "Minori「Seemed like she was in a bit of trouble.＿She was kinda pissed, but it didn't＿seem like an emergency or anything.」"
msgstr "Minori「Parecía estar en un pequeño aprieto.＿Estaba algo molesta, pero no parecía una＿emergencia ni nada por el estilo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. But are you sure I should go?＿Are you busy or something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. ¿Pero seguro que debo ir＿yo? ¿Estás ocupada o algo así?」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, yeah, I'm headed to work, and＿plus......」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, sí, voy camino al trabajo,＿y además......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué ocurre?」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, no, it's nothing. Sorry, I just got to＿the diner, so I gotta go or I'll be late.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ah, no, no es nada. Perdón, acabo＿de llegar al restaurante y debo＿irme o llegaré tarde.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wouldn't want you to be late. Alright,＿leave the rest to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No quisiera que llegues tarde.＿Bien, déjame el resto a mí.」"

msgid "Minori「I'm really sorry about this. Thanks. See＿ya.」"
msgstr "Minori「Perdón de verdad por esto.＿Gracias. Nos vemos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's Taiga gotten herself into?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿En qué se habrá metido Taiga?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I went to the trouble of making it......＿and cleaning up...... I wanted to see the＿look on her face...... Well, this isn't）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Me tomé la molestia de hacerlo...... y＿limpiar...... Quería ver la expresión de＿su cara...... Bueno, esto no es）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（enough to warrant surprise, I guess......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（como para sorprenderse, supongo......）」"

msgid "Minori「It's just, Taiga called me earlier and＿asked me to come over to her house,＿but I was wondering if you could go in」"
msgstr "Minori「Es que Taiga me llamó hace rato y me＿pidió que fuera a su casa, pero me＿preguntaba si podrías ir tú en」"

msgid "Minori「my place.」"
msgstr "Minori「mi lugar.」"
